Id: aud011i
Severity: INFO
Category: logging
Check: check_accounting
References: accton(8); acct(5); lastcomm(1)

Process accounting is on: accton is installed, its file exists (and,
on the running system, has been written to within the day), and a
service turns it on at boot. 'lastcomm' and 'sa' answer which account
ran what, and when. This names the arrangement in place; it is not a
gap.
